            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1056-f2" n="35" xml:id="d1056-f2-content">
                <p>Alberto Guani, former Minister for Foreign Affairs.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1056-f3" n="36" xml:id="d1056-f3-content">
                <p>Committee for Political Defense; for documentation, see <ref target="#pg76">pp.
